  aciklama:
  - "\"San\u0131r m\u0131s\u0131n ipimizden bir tutan var; zarlar at\u0131ld\u0131,
    kartlar da\u011F\u0131t\u0131ld\u0131? Her kula yollar \xE7izilip, karar nefse
    b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131. Manevi latifeler, dualard\u0131r ara\xE7; tevekk\xFClle
    \xE7al\u0131\u015Fanlar m\xFCjdelerle ku\u015Fat\u0131ld\u0131.\" Dilerim do\u011Fru
    izleri do\u011Fru \u015Fekilde takip eder, en g\xFCzel g\xFCnlere ula\u015F\u0131rs\u0131n
    {{isim}}.\n\nYeni bir kahve fal\u0131 yorumunda g\xF6r\xFC\u015Fmek \xFCzere...\n\nMagnus"
